# Unmanned Aircraft System Extension — gUFO alignment profile (bridge)
#
# Grounds the uas classes in the (gentle) Unified Foundational Ontology
# (gUFO, https://nemo-ufes.github.io/gufo/) for graphs using the CDO gUFO
# profile (CDO-Shapes-gufo).
#
#   - uas:UnmannedAircraft is a gufo:FunctionalComplex: an artifact whose
#     parts (airframe, flight controller, motors, radios) play distinct
#     functional roles, exactly as for vehicles and weapons. It is not a
#     gufo:Quantity — swapping a motor leaves the same aircraft, which is
#     what makes airframe identity worth tracking separately from the
#     autopilot board identity.
#   - uas:Flight and uas:FlightModeChange are gufo:Events: perdurants that
#     unfold in time and are not wholly present at any instant. A flight is
#     an extended event; a mode change is effectively instantaneous, but both
#     are the same ontological kind and both inherit uco-core:Event's
#     temporal properties.

@prefix uas: <http://example.org/ontology/uas/> .
@prefix gufo: <http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/ontology/uas/profile/gufo>
	a owl:Ontology ;
	rdfs:label "Unmanned Aircraft System Extension: gUFO alignment profile"@en ;
	dcterms:source "https://nemo-ufes.github.io/gufo/"^^xsd:anyURI .

uas:UnmannedAircraft rdfs:subClassOf gufo:FunctionalComplex .
uas:Flight rdfs:subClassOf gufo:Event .
uas:FlightModeChange rdfs:subClassOf gufo:Event .
